Package: selectrs
Type: Package
Title: Translate CSS Selectors to XPath Expressions (Rust Port of 'selectr')
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Simon", "Potter", email = "simon@sjp.co.nz",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Translates a CSS3 selector into an equivalent XPath expression.
    A standalone, API-compatible port of the 'selectr' package with the
    parsing and translation core implemented in Rust on top of Servo's
    'cssparser' and 'selectors' crates. This allows searching XML documents
    using CSS selectors with the same results as 'selectr', but faster.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/sjp/selectrs
BugReports: https://github.com/sjp/selectrs/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
